# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ML artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT: model/customer_model.pkl is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It is a required build artifact: it is baked into the Docker image
# (COPY model/ ...) and consumed by CI, so it MUST be committed to git.
# Do not add "*.pkl" or "model/" to this file.